            </profile>
            <profile name="Eater of Daemons" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait" hidden="false" id="9ac3-6635-d0bd-5ff7">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">If Sikari Dar is in the army's Primary Detachment she must be the army's Warlord, and as Warlord she automatically has this trait and no other. The first time any enemy unit with the Corrupted, Daemon or Psyker Sub-type comes within 12" of her for any reason, it must take a Leadership test. If it fails, all its models suffer -1 WS, BS and Initiative until the end of the next Game Turn. Each unit only tests once, but any number of units may trigger it.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
